  "actualChecks": [
    "Complete raw invalid/empty title, answer-line strings, source order, baseline, format/book choices and immutable pending/received requests survive canonical copies",
    "Browser result IDs and all four export slots match actual native prepared records; source duplicates/version mixing, foreign actor/role/student and extra fields are rejected",
