    "A generated HTTP service records a response then actually closes the socket; the real browser client recovers through the exact original GET",
    "Chromium retransmitted one logical POST twice at the transport layer, keeping exact bytes/key and one generated original record; two explicit logical retries produced four transport requests",
    "Injected IndexedDB denial still downloads a complete file containing raw settings plus unknown and received-unverified original requests; exact downloaded JSON read back"
